    "mode": "agent",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "seq": 1,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Hi Can, this is Hermes on your line, your AI assistant. How can I help?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:49:50.664+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 2,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "In case of a fast pickup, we ask you to let us know that you are not a voice mail system.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:49:55.923+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 3,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "So you need to press 1 to take this call.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:49:57.764+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 4,
        "speaker": "system",
        "text": "Pressed 1",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:03.033+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 5,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "I pressed 1, so I'm on the line now. How can I help you?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:04.013+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 6,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Hi. How are you?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:10.399+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 7,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "I'm doing well, thanks. What can I help you with today?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:11.718+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 8,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:17.241+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 9,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "I'm an AI assistant answering calls for Can. Who's calling, and what's it about?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:18.671+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 10,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "I am Can.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:25.940+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 11,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Hi Can, good to hear from you. What can I do for you?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:27.306+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 12,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Okay.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:35.454+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 13,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Take your time. Do you want me to take a note, or is there something you need help with?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:36.918+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 14,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Can you know who I am from my number?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:38.535+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 15,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Yes, the call is coming from your own phone number, so I assume it's you. Caller ID can be faked though, so anything that needs your approval still has to go through chat as usual.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:40.988+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 16,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Okay. Can you read my club limit right now and tell me?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:50:57.715+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 17,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Did you mean your Claude usage limit? I can't check that from this call, but I can leave a note so you get the answer in chat.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:00.693+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 18,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:04.605+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 19,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Got it. I can't see your Claude usage from this call, but I can leave a note so it gets checked and the answer shows up in your chat. Should I do that?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:06.243+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 20,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "Why not?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:07.445+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 21,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "On this call I only have phone tools, like pressing keys and ending the call, so I can't open your account. I can leave a note so the answer shows up in your chat. Want me to?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:09.104+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 22,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "What can you answer with, though?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:21.554+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 23,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "I can answer general questions from what I already know, take notes or messages for you, and handle phone menus. Anything that needs your accounts or files gets done in chat after the call.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:25.029+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 24,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "K.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:31.422+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 25,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "Anything that needs your accounts or files has to happen in chat. Should I leave a note to check your Claude usage limit?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:32.976+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 26,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "How old I am?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:34.052+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 27,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "I don't know your age, it isn't in anything I have access to here. Want me to add it to my notes if you tell me?",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:35.725+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 28,
        "speaker": "business",
        "text": "No. I'm all good. Thank you.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:43.914+00:00"
      },
      {
        "seq": 29,
        "speaker": "hermes",
        "text": "You're welcome, Can. Have a good one, bye.",
        "ts": "2026-11-05T20:51:48.101+00:00"
      }
    ],
